# Heroku account integration — encrypts stored Heroku API keys at rest (AES-256-GCM).
# Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
# Changing this makes every stored Heroku key undecryptable — there is no fallback
# path, by design. Rotating it means re-entering every connected account's key.
SECRET_ENCRYPTION_KEY=
